The '''Otherside''' is a sub-location of the [[Rift Dimension]]. It covers any area that is not part of another [[Zone]].

== Features ==
The '''Otherside''' features a few attractions.

=== Lake ===
The '''Otherside''' is full of water and is difficult to cross by just swimming. The player can place [[Lil' Pad]]s on the water to create a path that they can walk or jump across with ease. If the player stays underwater for too long, they will begin to drown and their [[Rift Time]] will decrease. Their {{Stat|Hearts}}, however, will not.

There is a large rock located in the water west of the [[Colosseum (Rift)|Colosseum]], but this rock serves no purpose other than to hide the roof of the [[Mirrorverse]]'s reward room.

=== Unbound Explorer ===
{{Main|Unbound Explorer}}
The [[Unbound Explorer]] is an extremely isolated [[NPC]] in the '''Otherside'''. They are located on a rock at the edge of the water, at the end of the '''Otherside''' furthest from the [[Wyld Woods]]. Since there is little to do in the '''Otherside''', the player can talk to the [[Unbound Explorer]] to get teleported back to the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} at no cost.

